":"孫慮〔孫綝從兄、太平元年逆呂據〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"慮","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0298"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-056","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-056-lvju","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0298","quote":"慮"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-056-lvju","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-056","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0298"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0298","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0298"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-056-lvju"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-wu056-lü-lin","subject_person_id":"s3e_n4d_au9","object_person_id":"hzw_vox_wvw","predicate":"agnatic_cousin","qualifiers":{"source_term":"又遣從兄慮以都下兵逆據於江都","sanguozhi056_family":"lü-lin"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-056","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-056-lvju","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056","quote":"　　據字世議。以父任為郎，後範寢疾，拜副軍校尉，佐領軍事。範卒，遷安軍中郎將。數討山賊，諸深惡劇地，所擊皆破、隨太常潘浚討五溪，復有功。朱然攻樊，據與朱異破城外圍，還拜偏將軍。入補馬閒右部督，遷越騎校尉。太元元年，大風，江水溢流，漸淹城門，權使視水，獨見據使人取大船以備害。權嘉之，拜蕩魏將軍。權寢疾，以據為太子右部督。太子即位，拜右將軍。魏出東興，據赴討有功。明年，孫峻殺諸葛恪，遷據為驃騎將軍，平西宮事。五鳳二年，假節，與峻等襲壽春，還遇魏將曹珍，破之於高亭。太平元年，帥師侵魏，未及淮，聞孫峻死，以從弟綝自代，據大怒，引軍還，欲廢綝。綝聞之，使中書奉詔，詔文欽、劉纂，唐咨等使取據，又遣從兄慮以都下兵逆據於江都。左右勸據降魏，據曰：「恥為叛臣。」遂自殺。夷三族。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0298","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0270"}],"interpretation_note":"慮為孫綝從兄；卷48同役作孫憲，未證同人。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0298","start":298,"end":299,"surface":"慮","kind":"person","person_id":"s3e_n4d_au9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-wu056-lü-lin","subject_person_id":"s3e_n4d_au9","object_person_id":"hzw_vox_wvw","predicate":"agnatic_cousin","qualifiers":{"source_term":"又遣從兄慮以都下兵逆據於江都","sanguozhi056_family":"lü-lin"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-056","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-056-lvju","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056","quote":"　　據字世議。以父任為郎，後範寢疾，拜副軍校尉，佐領軍事。範卒，遷安軍中郎將。數討山賊，諸深惡劇地，所擊皆破、隨太常潘浚討五溪，復有功。朱然攻樊，據與朱異破城外圍，還拜偏將軍。入補馬閒右部督，遷越騎校尉。太元元年，大風，江水溢流，漸淹城門，權使視水，獨見據使人取大船以備害。權嘉之，拜蕩魏將軍。權寢疾，以據為太子右部督。太子即位，拜右將軍。魏出東興，據赴討有功。明年，孫峻殺諸葛恪，遷據為驃騎將軍，平西宮事。五鳳二年，假節，與峻等襲壽春，還遇魏將曹珍，破之於高亭。太平元年，帥師侵魏，未及淮，聞孫峻死，以從弟綝自代，據大怒，引軍還，欲廢綝。綝聞之，使中書奉詔，詔文欽、劉纂，唐咨等使取據，又遣從兄慮以都下兵逆據於江都。左右勸據降魏，據曰：「恥為叛臣。」遂自殺。夷三族。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0298","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0270"}],"interpretation_note":"慮為孫綝從兄；卷48同役作孫憲，未證同人。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056","text":"　　據字世議。以父任為郎，後範寢疾，拜副軍校尉，佐領軍事。範卒，遷安軍中郎將。數討山賊，諸深惡劇地，所擊皆破、隨太常潘浚討五溪，復有功。朱然攻樊，據與朱異破城外圍，還拜偏將軍。入補馬閒右部督，遷越騎校尉。太元元年，大風，江水溢流，漸淹城門，權使視水，獨見據使人取大船以備害。權嘉之，拜蕩魏將軍。權寢疾，以據為太子右部督。太子即位，拜右將軍。魏出東興，據赴討有功。明年，孫峻殺諸葛恪，遷據為驃騎將軍，平西宮事。五鳳二年，假節，與峻等襲壽春，還遇魏將曹珍，破之於高亭。太平元年，帥師侵魏，未及淮，聞孫峻死，以從弟綝自代，據大怒，引軍還，欲廢綝。綝聞之，使中書奉詔，詔文欽、劉纂，唐咨等使取據，又遣從兄慮以都下兵逆據於江都。左右勸據降魏，據曰：「恥為叛臣。」遂自殺。夷三族。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"據","kind":"person","person_id":"0fp_euq_upj","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"世議","kind":"person","person_id":"0fp_euq_upj","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"範","kind":"person","person_id":"908_816_219","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"範","kind":"person","person_id":"908_816_219","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"潘浚","kind":"person","person_id":"pac_tt7_hs3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"朱然","kind":"person","person_id":"tut_0t1_tb8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvju:line056:m0073","start":73,"e